2.159.3 emacsvox-m-player Options
---------------------------------

 -- Variable: User Option emacsvox-m-player-clips
     Directory where we store clips.

     Default Value:

     "~/mp3/clips"


 -- Variable: User Option emacsvox-m-player-custom-filters
     Additional filters to apply to streams.

     Default Value:

     nil


 -- Variable: User Option emacsvox-media-location-bindings
     Map  keys  to launch MPlayer on a  directory.

     Default Value:

     nil



